<title>USA: PHH Corp started with buy.</title>
<headline>PHH Corp started with buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities analyst Cliff Ransom said he initiated coverage of PHH Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>&quot;(W)e believe that Wall Street does not yet fully appreciate the considerable promise still ahead of the company that should be derived from its relatively recent push into reorienting all of its traditional corporate and government services into...employee groups and from its increasing emphasis on cross-selling across its diverse customer base,&quot; Ransom said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 7/8 at 29-5/8</p>
</text>
